      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-306982",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/0f/0f45a8d74d162530062aa9c24f019d00be86573988c63e05626278b09c387c35.png)\n\nDiego rode a stationary bike for forty minutes, and his time and speed are shown on the graph above. According to the graph, which of the following statements is **not** true concerning Diego's ride?\n\n1. Diego's speed increased at a constant rate during the first eight minutes.\n2. Diego rode at a constant speed for ten minutes.\n3. Diego's speed reached its maximum during the last ten minutes.\n4. Diego's speed decreased at a constant rate during the last ten minutes."
