      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-307029",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/85/85648d02ef153e0d2b0019d66f647c6160caafbc25b16d5ccc370a962ec38e5a.png)\n\nA call center operated for twenty-four hours, and its time and handling rate are shown on the graph above. According to the graph, which of the following statements is **not** true concerning the call center\u2019s operation?\n\n1. The handling rate increased at a constant rate during the first four hours.\n2. The handling rate was constant for eight consecutive hours.\n3. The handling rate reached its maximum during the last eight hours.\n4. The handling rate decreased at a constant rate during the last four hours."
